WEBVTT

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.217
(Applause)

00:15:30.258 --> 00:15:32.052
this superhero,

00:15:32.094 --> 00:15:34.972
from looking at a piece
of art in the museum.

00:15:35.013 --> 00:15:36.848
And he designed this.

00:15:36.848 --> 00:15:39.893
But now Isaiah is designing
logos for people.

00:15:40.894 --> 00:15:43.647
Yeah, yeah, I love it.

00:15:44.147 --> 00:15:49.111
So give them room and space
to follow their delights.

00:15:49.695 --> 00:15:51.488
And then lastly,

00:15:51.488 --> 00:15:53.490
let them solve their own problems.

00:15:53.865 --> 00:15:57.244
Entrepreneurs are problem solvers,

00:15:57.285 --> 00:15:59.830
and as parents it is our natural instinct

00:15:59.871 --> 00:16:02.916
to want to step in and help our kids
solve their problems.